evidence CLOUD:
  "Exact failed revision kshiai-api-00168-zud logs ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND: Cannot find package openai imported from /app/backend/dist/llm/openai-compatible.js; Node22 exits1 before port8080 listening. Service traffic API confirms previous speech-9ce565d at100percent. Stage migrations passed; Worker and paid battle step skipped."
evidence LAYOUT:
  "Lockfile installs openai6.49 at backend/node_modules/openai. Root node_modules/openai absent. Docker dependencies stage npm ci installs backend and shared workspaces; runtime copies only root node_modules. Independent bounded local reproduction with compiled backend and root-only dependency layout emits same missing-package error."
evidence DETECTION:
  "Both exact PR and main CI passed. backend-image job builds and scans vulnerabilities but never imports compiled modules from final image. Normal local tests retain backend/node_modules and therefore differ from final runtime layout."
premise INFERENCE:
  "Runtime copy omits workspace-local installed production dependencies, directly producing missing openai. SDK placement change triggered this existing packaging assumption. Container startup probe error is consequence, not evidence of a too-short timeout."
premise ALTERNATIVES:
  "Port/deadline tuning cannot fix the proven module resolution failure. Changing hoisting or duplicating openai at root changes package ownership unnecessarily. Lazy import merely postpones failure. Preserve dependency layout in image."
premise UNKNOWN:
  "After package inclusion, cloud initialization and model battle completion still require actual staging and public observations; no local check alone establishes these."
decision REPAIR based_on CLOUD, LAYOUT, DETECTION, INFERENCE, ALTERNATIVES, UNKNOWN:
  "Preserve backend and shared workspace production node_modules in final image, ensuring empty directories exist for deterministic COPY. Add final-image compiled LLM/routes import smoke under NODE_ENV=test and legacy auth with no keys, index startup, DB initialization or provider calls. Verify same controlled layout after inclusion and all required CI checks on a new scoped PR. Release rc4 rather than moving immutable failed rc3, repeat official staged verification then authorized public promotion and completion."
